									<w:shd w:val="clear" w:color="auto" w:fill="FFFFFF" />
									<w:lang w:val="en-US" w:eastAsia="zh-CN" /></w:rPr>
								<w:t>The result of the variation of mismatch repair genes is determined to be dMMR if there is a function-affected mutation, and pMMR if none.</w:t>
							</w:r>
						</w:p>
